WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.762
Week 7: Questions and High-Frequency Irregulars. request specific information state ability and intention repair a misunderstanding

2
00:00:08.762 --> 00:00:28.391
Read for the situation. Marta quiere visitar el mercado, pero no sabe cuándo abre. Llama a información, pregunta por el horario y pide que repitan la dirección. Marta wants to visit the market, but she does not know when it opens. She calls information, asks about the schedule, and asks them to repeat the address.

3
00:00:28.391 --> 00:00:36.961
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:36.961 --> 00:00:43.931
Reading activities. Reading activity 15; Reading activity 16; Reading activity 17

5
00:00:43.931 --> 00:00:51.711
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:51.711 --> 00:01:11.676
Model language. ¿Qué quiere hacer hoy? — What do you want to do today? ¿Cuándo viene el autobús? — When does the bus come? No sé; ¿puede repetirlo? — I don't know; can you repeat that? Tengo que hacer una llamada. — I have to make a call. ¿Por qué dices eso? — Why do you say that?

7
00:01:11.676 --> 00:01:21.425
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
